WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:13.096
Ugh..

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:22.063
Um, excuse me, is this...

00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:24.107
Oh, yeah, that's mine.

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:25.191
Oh, okay.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:26.818
Could I use it next?

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:27.944
Oh, sure, go ahead.

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:28.737
Thank you.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:31.531
Zero-seven-zero...

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:32.574
Yes.

00:00:34.075 --> 00:00:36.077
Oh, a satisfaction survey— sure, that's fine...

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.498
Five minutes? Yeah, five minutes should be fine.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:41.624
Okay.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.126
Mm.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:43.710
Nice.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.131
Oh, yes, I'd say I'm satisfied, all of it.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.341
Okay.

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:51.676
Ah...

00:00:52.093 --> 00:00:52.886
&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=#EFAD00FF&gt;Huh?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:53.845
&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=#EFAD00FF&gt;Oh...&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:55.722
&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=#EFAD00FF&gt;I mean, I was here first, but—&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:58.016
Maybe it's not dry enough yet?

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:00.894
Should I run it ten more minutes?

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:04.355
Yes, very satisfied.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:05.732
Is that good—

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:06.733
Yes, thank you.

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:07.942
Sure.

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:09.444
Oh, I'm all done here.

00:01:09.694 --> 00:01:11.154
Yeah, you can use it now.

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:12.072
Thank you.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:12.655
Sure.

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:13.490
Go ahead, go ahead.

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:16.576
Okay.

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:35.637
Oh, haha

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:40.350
Oh, what floor should I press?

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:41.559
I'm on twenty— oh—

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:43.520
I'm on twenty-four too.

00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:45.188
Oh, wow.

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:55.698
The elevator's really hot, huh?

00:01:56.991 --> 00:01:57.534
Yeah.

00:01:57.742 --> 00:01:58.660
Right.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:00.870
They stop running the AC after the first day of fall.

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:04.707
But if you call the management office,

00:02:04.707 --> 00:02:06.251
they might turn it back on.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:07.669
Oh, really?

00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:08.753
Oh, really?

00:02:09.087 --> 00:02:10.630
Wow, I should try that.

00:02:11.047 --> 00:02:11.965
Thank you.

00:02:13.258 --> 00:02:15.093
&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=#EFAD00FF&gt;Guess I'll have to say hi from now on whenever we run into each other.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;

00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:19.180
A dog.

00:02:23.893 --> 00:02:24.644
Aw, sweetie.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:27.272
Where's your mom?

00:02:28.398 --> 00:02:29.607
So cute.

00:02:34.362 --> 00:02:35.572
Oh, hi.

00:02:36.364 --> 00:02:38.032
Oh, hi.

00:02:38.032 --> 00:02:39.159
Is that your dog?

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:41.536
Oh, no, no, actually—

00:02:41.536 --> 00:02:42.787
I think someone abandoned it.

00:02:42.787 --> 00:02:43.496
What?

00:02:46.082 --> 00:02:48.168
It's right by the road, that's dangerous.

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:49.085
Right.

00:02:49.085 --> 00:02:50.086
Um...

00:02:50.086 --> 00:02:51.087
What should we do?

00:02:58.428 --> 00:02:59.846
Let's just put it in the car for now.

00:03:00.471 --> 00:03:03.099
I mean, whether we take it to the vet or the police,

00:03:03.099 --> 00:03:05.685
since we're the ones who found it, I feel like we're responsible.

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:06.811
No, no.

00:03:07.395 --> 00:03:08.813
I think we should just leave it here.

00:03:09.772 --> 00:03:12.442
If you took every stray cat or dog to the vet every time you saw one,

00:03:12.442 --> 00:03:14.194
you couldn't even afford the bills,

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:17.363
and if the owner shows up nearby, it should be right where it was,

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:18.823
so it's easier for them to find it.

00:03:18.823 --> 00:03:19.407
Right.

00:03:19.407 --> 00:03:20.200
Ah...

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.284
I think leaving it here is the right call.

00:03:22.619 --> 00:03:23.453
Oh.

00:03:24.287 --> 00:03:26.456
Yeah, yeah, leave it—

00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:27.624
for now. Yeah, for now.

00:03:31.753 --> 00:03:34.130
If you're heading home, want to ride together?

00:03:34.505 --> 00:03:35.215
Oh...

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:36.633
Um...

00:03:36.633 --> 00:03:38.092
Oh, yeah, thanks.

00:03:38.509 --> 00:03:39.052
Yeah.

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:39.719
Okay.

00:03:45.308 --> 00:03:46.684
Actually, about the dog—

00:03:47.936 --> 00:03:49.771
I was glad you were the one who said to leave it.

00:03:50.021 --> 00:03:52.315
Oh, well, there wasn't much choice—

00:03:52.315 --> 00:03:55.735
right, but I felt like just leaving it would make me look like a bad person,

00:03:56.319 --> 00:03:58.321
so I was kind of overdoing it.

00:03:58.321 --> 00:03:59.239
But the moment

00:03:59.697 --> 00:04:01.324
you said "let's just leave it,"

00:04:01.324 --> 00:04:04.202
it's kind of awful, but

00:04:04.202 --> 00:04:05.828
inside I was thinking, 'oh, thank god.'

00:04:06.287 --> 00:04:07.288
So...

00:04:07.789 --> 00:04:09.290
Ugh, I'm so terrible, right?

00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:13.294
I think that's the kind of thing only a genuinely nice person would think.

00:04:13.294 --> 00:04:14.337
Oh, you think so?

00:04:18.508 --> 00:04:20.510
Could I get a copy of the dog photo?

00:04:21.511 --> 00:04:23.012
Oh, the photo?

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:36.943
[Looking for this dog's owner]

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:38.278
Huh, she actually posted it.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.198
Wow, she's given away so much stuff.

00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:47.996
[Did the owner reach out?]

00:04:48.454 --> 00:04:50.331
[This is the person who found the dog with you]

00:04:50.999 --> 00:04:52.417
[Oh, not yet]

00:05:01.426 --> 00:05:02.677
[Just a false alarm, right?]

00:05:03.177 --> 00:05:04.220
[What if it's not?]

00:05:05.013 --> 00:05:06.139
[Hmm...]

00:05:06.139 --> 00:05:07.223
[Guess I should go check.]

00:05:12.145 --> 00:05:13.146
Excuse me,

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:14.022
it's not an actual fire, right?

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:15.773
No, they said it's a false alarm.

00:05:15.773 --> 00:05:17.108
Don't worry.

00:05:18.026 --> 00:05:19.485
You can go back in.

00:05:22.447 --> 00:05:24.407
[Haha.. thanks for checking]

00:05:25.283 --> 00:05:26.701
[Haha.. you heard that?]

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:28.119
[Yeah]

00:05:33.708 --> 00:05:35.460
Oh, this contest submission's due today—

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:39.297
is it okay for two of us to sit at a table for four?

00:05:40.131 --> 00:05:41.758
Dongguk and Jihan are meeting us at the convenience store later.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:42.759
Oh...

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:44.761
Don't you kind of need to poop right now?

00:05:44.761 --> 00:05:45.762
Yeah, you smell like poop.

00:05:45.762 --> 00:05:46.763
Oh, really? Thanks.

00:05:47.889 --> 00:05:49.182
Hey, my battery's at 7%.

00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:50.433
Huh?

00:05:50.892 --> 00:05:53.019
There's no outlet around here, though.

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:55.146
Actually there's one outlet spot,

00:05:55.146 --> 00:05:56.022
but someone's sitting there.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:58.733
Ugh, the deadline's today, we have to get this done.

00:05:59.275 --> 00:06:02.236
It's such a big table, they've got an outlet and it seats four.

00:06:02.236 --> 00:06:03.738
We have to finish this contest thing by today.

00:06:04.447 --> 00:06:05.490
&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=#EFAD00FF&gt;Ugh...&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;

00:06:06.157 --> 00:06:06.824
Isn't there anywhere else to charge?

00:06:06.824 --> 00:06:07.950
Um, excuse me—

00:06:08.743 --> 00:06:11.746
our table's a bigger one, so

00:06:11.746 --> 00:06:13.748
if it's okay, want to switch tables with us?

00:06:13.748 --> 00:06:15.208
Oh, we'd— yeah, thank you.

00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:16.417
Yeah, we don't really need the outlet.

00:06:16.417 --> 00:06:17.752
Oh, the outlet, right.

00:06:17.752 --> 00:06:19.420
Okay, let me ask my friend and switch you over.

00:06:19.629 --> 00:06:20.755
Thank you.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:21.756
Thank you.

00:06:21.839 --> 00:06:22.757
Thank you.

00:06:23.132 --> 00:06:23.758
What'd they look like?

00:06:23.758 --> 00:06:24.550
Hey, hey—

00:06:25.301 --> 00:06:25.802
So—

00:06:25.802 --> 00:06:27.720
the people at that table over there,

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.514
they really need an outlet,

00:06:29.514 --> 00:06:30.765
is it okay if we switch seats with them?

00:06:31.307 --> 00:06:31.933
Now?

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:36.312
Oh, haha

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:38.106
Sure, it's fine.

00:06:38.606 --> 00:06:39.232
Let's switch.

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:39.816
Oh, seriously.

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:42.443
Here, sit here.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:44.821
Thank you.

00:06:44.821 --> 00:06:45.738
Oh, it's no problem.

00:06:45.738 --> 00:06:46.823
Good luck with your work.

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:50.243
Ugh, what is this—

00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:50.952
Sorry about that.

00:06:51.119 --> 00:06:52.120
Ah, this is so much better.

00:06:52.787 --> 00:06:54.122
The AC doesn't reach over here.

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:55.081
It's freezing, though?

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:56.958
Did we switch for nothing?

00:06:59.127 --> 00:07:00.128
That's not what I meant.

00:07:00.586 --> 00:07:02.130
I can't even say anything.

00:07:05.633 --> 00:07:06.467
Mm, that looks so good.

00:07:06.467 --> 00:07:07.135
Hey.

00:07:07.969 --> 00:07:10.763
Dongguk, what are you doing hanging around some other girl?

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:11.889
Hi.

00:07:11.889 --> 00:07:12.515
Let's hurry up and go.

00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:15.351
Wait, since it's our first time going over, shouldn't we bring something?

00:07:15.518 --> 00:07:16.394
No, no, no—

00:07:16.519 --> 00:07:17.353
Oh.

00:07:17.854 --> 00:07:19.188
Okay, hold on a sec.

00:07:19.188 --> 00:07:20.189
Just wait one second.

00:07:20.189 --> 00:07:21.190
I'll just run into the store.

00:07:22.483 --> 00:07:23.276
Ha ha ha

00:07:23.401 --> 00:07:23.734
Ha ha

00:07:24.026 --> 00:07:24.652
Ha ha ha

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:26.779
So this is the living room,

00:07:27.029 --> 00:07:27.738
and this is the master room.

00:07:28.197 --> 00:07:28.990
Excuse the intrusion.

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:30.032
Oh, nice.

00:07:30.283 --> 00:07:31.200
This is really nice.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:31.784
Huh?

00:07:32.034 --> 00:07:33.035
Nice, toilet paper, good thinking.

00:07:33.202 --> 00:07:33.786
Who got this?

00:07:33.995 --> 00:07:35.204
Oh, we all chipped in for it.

00:07:35.413 --> 00:07:36.622
Come on, you didn't all chip in.

00:07:36.622 --> 00:07:37.832
Kyungsung, the nice one, bought it,

00:07:37.832 --> 00:07:40.168
and the rest of us have such bad manners we didn't even think of it.

00:07:41.127 --> 00:07:42.128
What's with that, haha.

00:07:42.378 --> 00:07:43.463
Oh, except Jihan.

00:07:43.671 --> 00:07:44.672
Ha ha ha ha

00:07:45.506 --> 00:07:46.507
Oh, here's the utensils.

00:07:46.507 --> 00:07:48.009
Thanks.

00:07:51.846 --> 00:07:52.847
Oh, I've got it, let me.

00:07:52.847 --> 00:07:53.848
Oh, it's fine, I've got it.

00:07:53.848 --> 00:07:54.849
But it's really fine—

00:07:54.974 --> 00:07:55.475
Huh?

00:07:56.434 --> 00:07:57.393
Thank you.

00:07:59.854 --> 00:08:00.855
Whoa.

00:08:00.855 --> 00:08:01.856
Oh, this'll look cool.

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:03.191
Nice.

00:08:06.277 --> 00:08:07.320
Oh, let me have that.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:07.653
Huh?

00:08:07.653 --> 00:08:08.112
Let me have it.

00:08:08.112 --> 00:08:08.738
Oh, no—

00:08:08.738 --> 00:08:09.572
Let me take it.

00:08:10.156 --> 00:08:11.157
But I'm closer—

00:08:11.782 --> 00:08:14.118
If you keep doing that, what does that make me look like?

00:08:14.285 --> 00:08:16.537
I just figured I could do it, that's all.

00:08:16.537 --> 00:08:17.747
Ah, just let her be, let her be.

00:08:18.122 --> 00:08:20.500
It's basically a passive skill — standing next to Kyungsung automatically makes you the bad guy.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:21.125
That'll look great.

00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:22.835
Let Kyungsung do whatever she wants.

00:08:23.544 --> 00:08:25.421
People are nice because the weaker you are, the more help you can get,

00:08:25.421 --> 00:08:26.964
that's why people bother being nice,

00:08:27.298 --> 00:08:28.341
but Kyungsung, well—

00:08:28.341 --> 00:08:29.425
she's pretty enough she doesn't need to be nice.

00:08:29.675 --> 00:08:31.093
Oh, right, you really are so pretty.

00:08:31.219 --> 00:08:31.969
Did you say pig?

00:08:34.889 --> 00:08:35.765
Pig..

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:38.726
&lt;i&gt;Wait, but—&lt;/i&gt;

00:08:38.726 --> 00:08:40.937
&lt;i&gt;if just standing there makes someone the bad guy,&lt;/i&gt;

00:08:40.937 --> 00:08:41.812
&lt;i&gt;is that actually "nice"?&lt;/i&gt;

00:08:42.522 --> 00:08:44.565
&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=#EFAD00FF&gt;Ugh, I should've just done nothing.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:46.609
Hah..

00:08:52.114 --> 00:08:53.407
Excuse me,

00:08:53.407 --> 00:08:54.867
can I take one of these candies?

00:08:55.368 --> 00:08:56.827
Oh, of course.

00:08:56.827 --> 00:08:57.787
They're there for anyone to take.

00:08:59.664 --> 00:09:00.790
Thank you.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:03.251
I used to hand them out to every passenger myself,

00:09:03.668 --> 00:09:05.002
but some people seemed uncomfortable with that.

00:09:06.254 --> 00:09:08.589
So now I just leave them out for whoever wants one.

00:09:14.679 --> 00:09:17.682
&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=#EFAD00FF&gt;Because I'm someone who has less than others,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;

00:09:17.682 --> 00:09:20.434
&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=#EFAD00FF&gt;because of the help I might need someday—&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;

00:09:20.685 --> 00:09:22.687
Oh, hi, are you the owner of plate 9188?

00:09:22.687 --> 00:09:24.188
Your hazard lights are on.

00:09:24.188 --> 00:09:26.023
&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=#EFAD00FF&gt;is that why I'm kind?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;

00:09:30.236 --> 00:09:31.612
Haah.

00:09:38.703 --> 00:09:39.161
Huh?

00:09:39.537 --> 00:09:39.745
Huh?

00:09:39.745 --> 00:09:40.162
Oh?

00:09:40.621 --> 00:09:41.497
Hi.

00:09:41.581 --> 00:09:42.373
Hi.

00:09:42.373 --> 00:09:42.707
Thank you.

00:09:42.707 --> 00:09:43.666
Oh, no, it's fine.

00:09:48.588 --> 00:09:50.423
The elevator,

00:09:50.423 --> 00:09:51.841
doesn't it feel a bit cooler now?

00:09:52.758 --> 00:09:54.260
Oh, it does.

00:09:54.802 --> 00:09:56.220
Did you call the management office?

00:09:56.971 --> 00:09:57.972
No way.

00:09:57.972 --> 00:09:58.848
Thank you.

00:10:00.516 --> 00:10:02.268
Well, if I don't mention

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:03.894
the good thing I did, no one would ever know,

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:05.813
so I bragged a little.

00:10:05.896 --> 00:10:07.023
Oh, bragging.

00:10:07.398 --> 00:10:09.150
Oh, I don't have anything to give you—

00:10:10.067 --> 00:10:10.818
Oh wait, I do.

00:10:13.487 --> 00:10:13.946
Ta-da.

00:10:13.946 --> 00:10:15.114
Oh, this is for me?

00:10:15.615 --> 00:10:17.116
This is a really precious thing.

00:10:17.241 --> 00:10:17.992
Precious.

00:10:19.493 --> 00:10:21.120
I'll display it somewhere nice.

00:10:27.001 --> 00:10:27.877
Get home safe.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:28.878
You too, get home safe.

00:10:35.468 --> 00:10:37.219
Um, so—

00:10:37.219 --> 00:10:38.638
did you hear anything about the dog?

00:10:39.388 --> 00:10:40.640
Oh, not yet.

00:10:41.641 --> 00:10:43.643
I keep checking the notifications, though.

00:10:45.186 --> 00:10:47.647
Then if it's okay, want to change into something comfortable

00:10:47.647 --> 00:10:49.357
and take a walk around to look for it?

00:10:49.523 --> 00:10:50.524
Just in case the dog's around?

00:10:52.568 --> 00:10:53.277
Yeah.

00:10:54.612 --> 00:10:55.613
Meet in the lobby in five?

00:10:55.905 --> 00:10:56.572
Lobby in five?

00:10:56.697 --> 00:10:57.281
Okay, okay.

00:10:57.698 --> 00:10:58.282
Sounds good.

00:10:58.282 --> 00:10:58.991
See you in a bit.

00:10:58.991 --> 00:10:59.533
Okay.

00:11:04.914 --> 00:11:05.706
This—

00:11:05.706 --> 00:11:06.332
Oh.

00:11:07.458 --> 00:11:08.042
Did you buy this?

00:11:08.876 --> 00:11:09.585
How much was it?

00:11:09.585 --> 00:11:10.252
No, no, it's fine.

00:11:16.884 --> 00:11:17.635
Do you feel sorry for me?

00:11:17.843 --> 00:11:19.762
I've never once thought that.

00:11:19.804 --> 00:11:21.472
No, Dongduk, it's not

00:11:21.472 --> 00:11:23.099
your fault that you live somewhere nicer than me,

00:11:23.099 --> 00:11:24.517
it's not something you did wrong.

00:11:25.267 --> 00:11:28.437
So why do you keep watching my reaction and pretending to be poor?

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.732
What, does that make you feel superior or something?

00:11:31.732 --> 00:11:32.900
Is that why you do it?

